*Burr*

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:22.310
The Hundred Years War ended that day, but that had no meaning.

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:28.000
When I saw that, my own endless battle had begun.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:37.370
This is Udo, the evil town of the planet Melkia that the Hundred Years War brought down.

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:39.390
Hehehehe

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:45.560
There's no more. If you hit it, it's three times.

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:01.030
Battling.

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:06.770
A war-torn beast becomes a target and shows its AT combat.

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:09.900
But theirs is even better.

00:05:12.180 --> 00:05:14.900
I'm doing what they call a "real battle."

00:05:15.850 --> 00:05:18.080
I'm using a gun with a bullet.

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:20.430
The fast talk is the real battle.

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:23.030
That's why the price is high.

00:06:02.970 --> 00:06:03.590
Hurry

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:02.590
We'll be right back.

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:51.120
We meet again.

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:54.610
