00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:02.430
Please untie me. I won't resist.

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:16.790
Are you going to kill me? What's your name?

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:18.570
Prot-1.

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:21.470
That's not a name.

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:27.170
I've been called Prot-1.

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:43.480
I always looked at you.

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:53.320
At first, you were in the darkness of the small planet Rido, right?

00:08:53.320 --> 00:08:56.750
When I was born and my consciousness awoke,

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:58.550
I saw it for the first time.

00:08:58.550 --> 00:08:59.670
That was...

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:09.540
You are the light I saw for the first time in my life.

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:38.100
I still didn't know the AT unit of the army that was falling like snow.

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:44.500
She had to protect a whole city, P.S.

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:53.180
In other words, what is the ultimate secret of the army called Perfect Soldier?

00:09:53.180 --> 00:09:59.280
All forces, attack!

00:10:29.150 --> 00:10:30.000
Melchior

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.300
Destruction and destruction of an anti-aircraft weapon squad.

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:37.270
Fire and smoke separated me and her.

00:10:37.270 --> 00:10:42.160
No, she was taken away by a mysterious organization in chaos.

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:14.950
Udo will disappear, Udo.

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:59.890
The heat, humidity, fever, and death.

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:07.190
I was painted in green, but this place must be hell, too.

00:12:07.190 --> 00:12:13.160
After three months of escaping from Udo, I was immersed in the torrent of internal conflict.

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:29.410
The internal conflict of internal conflict is a conflict between the former imperialist and the revolutionary.

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:34.340
For me, the end of the war didn't matter.

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:40.100
A curious rumor led me to the JUNGLE of KUMEN.

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:44.630
It's a rumor of the AT of the guerrilla side called the "Blue Devil".

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:44.820
That's right. Stop it! Stop it!

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:09.860
No! Who are you?

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:11.220
Are you Kiriko?

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:13.380
You're also a Perfect Soldier.

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:17.890
That's right. I'm a Perfect Soldier who surpassed humans.

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:19.360
I'm the chosen warrior.

00:14:19.360 --> 00:14:22.150
Protowan was supposed to follow that path.

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:24.530
