00:23:00.830 --> 00:23:04.080
I have a place to survive.

00:23:04.080 --> 00:23:07.430
Stop. Live for me.

00:23:48.840 --> 00:23:53.620
It is true that I escaped from the Kumen jungle with Fianna.

00:23:53.620 --> 00:23:56.110
That is an undeniable fact.

00:23:56.110 --> 00:23:58.130
And...

00:24:00.380 --> 00:24:10.900
Right after that, we were taken in by something.

00:24:10.900 --> 00:24:16.580
When we realized, we were inside a huge battleship.

00:24:33.100 --> 00:24:35.900
The control system and the communication system are locked.

00:24:35.900 --> 00:24:37.960
The manual doesn't work either.

00:24:37.960 --> 00:24:50.280
It's controlled by an automatic navigation system.

00:24:50.280 --> 00:24:52.270
What's going on here?

00:24:52.270 --> 00:25:00.000
