00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:01.440
Where are they heading to?

00:25:01.440 --> 00:25:03.540
I'll give you an answer right away.

00:25:03.540 --> 00:25:10.240
They're refusing to come on board.

00:25:10.240 --> 00:25:11.590
Why?

00:25:11.590 --> 00:25:16.330
Who sent us on this ship?

00:25:16.330 --> 00:25:19.650
They're refusing to come on board.

00:25:19.650 --> 00:25:23.720
For what?

00:25:23.720 --> 00:25:25.830
What are they going to do with us?

00:25:40.140 --> 00:25:45.020
I wonder where this ship is taking me.

00:25:45.020 --> 00:25:47.600
No matter where you go, I'll always be by your side.

00:26:12.890 --> 00:26:19.710
Our ship, without knowing the destination, was judging the Baralans.

00:26:19.710 --> 00:26:22.920
It was as if it were fighting against me.

00:27:28.760 --> 00:27:29.730
Where is the crime scene?

00:27:30.440 --> 00:27:32.220
Is there no other way but to fight?

00:27:54.500 --> 00:27:59.120
Into the Tetsu no Kishimi and the Shōen...

00:28:00.000 --> 00:28:05.980
They are guiding us.

00:28:05.980 --> 00:28:09.830
There is no doubt that someone is playing with us.

00:28:09.830 --> 00:28:15.400
The one who was waiting for us at the end of the ship was Epsilon.

00:29:11.930 --> 00:29:13.880
Kirikou, are you alright?

00:29:13.880 --> 00:29:15.210
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:29:15.210 --> 00:29:16.760
Kiana, go inside.

00:29:16.760 --> 00:29:18.110
I'll ask for your help from the inside.

00:29:18.110 --> 00:29:19.130
From the inside?

00:29:19.130 --> 00:29:21.780
I'll take Epsilon to the front of the main nozzles.

00:29:21.780 --> 00:29:23.990
Wait for me in the control room.

00:29:23.990 --> 00:29:25.250
Kirikou!

00:30:10.040 --> 00:30:13.000
