00:30:33.200 --> 00:30:34.230
I'm counting on you!

00:31:24.920 --> 00:31:25.410
Let's go!

00:31:33.160 --> 00:31:33.620
Now!

00:32:00.000 --> 00:32:06.750
Those who play with our fates are looking for a solution.

00:32:06.750 --> 00:32:17.860
What is the meaning of the battle between me and PS, or Epsilon, or one of them, Nagasuchi?

00:32:50.220 --> 00:32:59.640
I swore that I would take revenge on you with my first move, but I hate you and I can fight you like a PS.

00:33:00.280 --> 00:33:02.090
It's a shame to kill you!

00:33:02.090 --> 00:33:04.520
You don't realize it.

00:33:04.520 --> 00:33:06.690
The reason why you were trained as a PS...

00:33:06.690 --> 00:33:08.260
I have no interest in such things!

00:33:08.260 --> 00:33:10.030
I only live to fight.

00:33:10.030 --> 00:33:11.760
I only live to win.

00:33:11.760 --> 00:33:13.350
That's all!

00:33:13.350 --> 00:33:14.880
Die!

00:33:30.760 --> 00:33:33.200
I can see it! His movements are perfect!

00:34:38.320 --> 00:34:39.510
Stop it already!

00:34:39.510 --> 00:34:41.490
Fiara, what are you trying to say?

00:34:41.490 --> 00:34:43.570
Ipsiro can't move anymore!

00:34:43.570 --> 00:34:46.200
If you insist on doing this,

00:34:46.200 --> 00:34:53.670
I'll kill you!

00:34:53.670 --> 00:34:56.310
You're a BS too!

00:34:57.310 --> 00:34:58.580
What?

00:34:58.580 --> 00:35:00.000
Like Ipsiro,

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:04.520
I don't believe there is a person who can fight against PS like that!

00:35:04.520 --> 00:35:06.480
What are you talking about?

00:35:06.480 --> 00:35:09.060
You are PS.

00:35:09.060 --> 00:35:09.950
You are.

00:35:30.190 --> 00:35:36.890
I didn't know you were of the same race as me.

00:35:36.890 --> 00:35:40.430
Certainly, you are also a PS.

00:35:40.430 --> 00:35:44.280
No, I'm a PS!

00:35:44.280 --> 00:35:49.240
If I didn't appear, I would have kept my pride of dying.

00:35:49.240 --> 00:35:56.850
There is no way I would lose to an ordinary human.

00:36:08.440 --> 00:36:09.250
Yves Chiron...

00:36:09.250 --> 00:36:13.730
That person...

00:36:13.730 --> 00:36:16.270
It might be me who killed you...

00:36:16.270 --> 00:36:18.160
I don't know...

00:36:18.160 --> 00:36:20.440
Kiriko...

00:36:20.440 --> 00:36:21.410
It was you...

00:36:37.480 --> 00:36:45.620
I won the battle against PS, and I took on the title of Wiseman, who rules the Astragius Galaxy.

00:37:01.440 --> 00:37:02.850
You say I'm Inocha?

00:37:02.850 --> 00:37:12.200
The ruler of the Astragius Galaxy.

00:37:12.200 --> 00:37:23.150
You say I'm your successor?

00:37:23.150 --> 00:37:27.010
I understand.

00:37:27.010 --> 00:37:29.410
I will gladly become your successor.

00:37:47.180 --> 00:37:48.440
Enter the elementary school belt!

00:37:48.440 --> 00:37:49.940
No, that's what I'm trying to do!

00:37:49.940 --> 00:37:54.130
B-24 Army, turn inside the elementary school belt!

00:38:23.390 --> 00:38:23.970
It's Eun-ri.

00:38:31.470 --> 00:38:47.500
What awaited me, who accepted Wiseman's will, were the group of missiles of the Alliance Space Force of Baralant and Gilgamesh.

00:38:47.500 --> 00:38:59.920
Of course, the successor of Wiseman, who has controlled this world as he wanted in the past three thousand years by war, I am the god who is about to die.

00:39:00.830 --> 00:39:02.760
He's just a son.

00:39:31.600 --> 00:40:00.000
I ran to my father, to the heart of Wiseman, to the absolute end of this world that I can't give to anyone.

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:04.770
Until I grasp the right to rule the world with my own hands...

00:42:00.410 --> 00:42:02.100
Let's get out of here!

00:42:02.100 --> 00:42:03.750
Don't get in my way!

00:42:03.750 --> 00:42:04.590
No!

00:42:04.590 --> 00:42:07.520
Do you want Wiseman's power so badly?

00:42:07.520 --> 00:42:09.670
It's meaningless!

00:42:09.670 --> 00:42:12.190
