00:42:12.190 --> 00:42:15.840
If you go any further, I'll kill you and I'll die, too!

00:42:15.840 --> 00:42:19.940
Kiriko!

00:42:19.940 --> 00:42:21.990
Kiriko!

00:42:44.040 --> 00:42:46.440
I did well, Kiriko.

00:42:46.440 --> 00:42:51.630
I understand your firm will, my successor.

00:42:51.630 --> 00:42:53.400
I want your power.

00:42:53.400 --> 00:42:55.220
Then proceed.

00:42:55.220 --> 00:42:58.000
Come up, Kiriko.

00:42:58.000 --> 00:42:59.190
Come on.

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:02.790
Hurry up and climb!

00:43:52.080 --> 00:44:00.000
Now, Kiriko, to follow my footsteps,

00:44:00.190 --> 00:44:04.820
You are already inside me.

00:44:04.820 --> 00:44:08.870
But even if I touch you, I can't do more than that.

00:44:08.870 --> 00:44:17.010
The knowledge and power that I have accumulated for three thousand years will be given to you in an instant.

00:44:17.010 --> 00:44:21.000
No, I can't move anymore.

00:44:21.000 --> 00:44:25.610
Is there anyone like you who wants to be weak?

00:44:25.610 --> 00:44:28.010
Stand up!

00:44:34.280 --> 00:44:37.530
Kiriko, what have you done?

00:44:37.530 --> 00:44:39.440
