00:44:39.440 --> 00:44:42.160
Don't be silly, Kiriko.

00:44:42.160 --> 00:44:45.500
Don't you want my power?

00:44:45.500 --> 00:44:48.530
Stop it, Kiriko.

00:44:48.530 --> 00:44:51.810
If you don't obey me, I'll kill you.

00:44:51.810 --> 00:44:52.950
Try it.

00:44:52.950 --> 00:44:55.450
I'm inside your nerves.

00:44:55.450 --> 00:44:58.550
No matter how much defense mechanism you have,

00:44:58.550 --> 00:44:59.890
inside you...

00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:05.000
